For the steel-soil interface, node 5:

\[
C_5''=
\rho_sC_{p,s}\frac{\Delta x_s}{2}
+\rho_gC_{p,g}\frac{\Delta x_g}{2}
\]

\[
C_5''=48,850.55+98,663.76
\]

\[
\boxed{C_5''=147,514.31\ \text{J/(m²·K)}}
\]

For soil interior nodes 6–9:

\[
C_g''=\rho_gC_{p,g}\Delta x_g
